        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nkhammei latjan su nimei gan tei,",
            "Tingmik thui naguang the;",
            "Rianramei le nthiammei @&4,",
            "Jaojimei rimei kum guange.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He ata npat lou ri o,",
            "Adang khou bamlou o;",
            "Zion ching ai guangtang mak san,",
            "Kanlou meipu nduang lou o.",
            "",
            "2. Ahu khou nthiammei dui @&4 dailiam ,",
            "Ai aman khang ping nge;",
            "Pap duidai khou kei loumei guai,",
            "Tingsang gaipui ramtang ngam mak.",
            "",
            "3. Noah kan khou pat kanmei tei kumma,",
            "Sodom kailuang kumma;",
            "Kandi ram ta ning khou @&4,",
            "Raguang ta npat lou ngam the.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih rianramei khanga bam khou hei,",
            "Nang jao kari pat ro;",
            "Zion nanun guai tei kum khang,",
            "Gundai pui tingmik guang pu khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
